        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Petrol, two-stroke blend, at regional storage
Rough estimation. Other mixing ratios from 1:5 up to 1:100 are possible. Energy use for mixing and additional fugitive emissions from mixing are neglected.;
UUID: 807e2067-46e0-379f-8c2a-939281c78fdc
Mixing of lubricant and petrol (ratio 1:50) at the petrol station.
Location: RER
Technology: Mixing of two-stroke petrol at the fuel station.
Time period: Literature publication for mixing ratio and time of estimation.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Own estimation based on mixing ratio. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_807e2067-46e0-379f-8c2a-939281c78fdc.xml</text>
